WEBVTT

00:32:28.419 --> 00:32:31.370
I think he worked harder
than probably most people I've met.

00:32:31.394 --> 00:32:35.616
He didn't leave the office,
he worked all the time,

00:32:35.640 --> 00:32:40.730
and so I think that there was this
maniacal focus on winning.

00:32:42.011 --> 00:32:44.929
You know, what winning means
is different to different people,

00:32:44.953 --> 00:32:48.175
but I think he wanted
to do incredibly big things,

00:32:48.199 --> 00:32:52.920
I think the definition of "big"
changed for him over time.

00:32:52.944 --> 00:32:56.942
I think we would set out
to do these fairly audacious things,

00:32:56.966 --> 00:32:58.774
we would achieve them,

00:32:58.798 --> 00:33:03.505
and then it would open up
a whole new world of what was possible,